      "content": "idk i already tried the saline thing and it didnt do much. the lisinopril keeps everything stable usually so i dont think a little bit of sudafed will mess it up too bad. how much of it is actually \"too much\" for someone with high blood pressure? like is there a safe dose i can take just to get through the night?",
